    "sub_name": "社會影響力專題",
    "sub_ename": "SEMINAR OF SOCIAL IMPACT",
    "describe_ch": "為了描述與評量社會創新的過程和成果，並對外揭露，以社會責信面對全球永續轉型的要求。據此本課程透過真實的計畫個案，帶領學生實作一份SRS社會影響力報告。",
    "describe_eh": "In order to describe and evaluate the process and results of social innovation, and disclose it to the outside world, it is necessary to meet the requirements of global sustainable transformation with social responsibility. Based on this, this course leads students to implement an SRS social impact report through real project cases.",
